  note 33 44 4 v 110
  note 38 48 4 v 110
  note 34 52 4 v 110
  note 33 56 4 v 110
  note 38 60 4 v 110

track Kick id kick gen gbaDirectSound * 16
  gen waveform pulse duty 50 vol 14 bitcrush true pitch_drop -5 pitch_dec 0.06
  adsr a 0 d 0.1 s 0 r 0.03
  note 34 0 0.14 v 90
  note 34 8 0.14 v 90
  note 34 16 0.14 v 90
  note 34 24 0.14 v 90
  note 34 32 0.14 v 90
  note 34 40 0.14 v 90
  note 34 48 0.14 v 90
  note 34 56 0.14 v 90

